 # lakeside-desk
 
+Documentation version: 0.2.0 (2026-10-28)
+
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts` creates an isolated, in-memory
+rental service. Add a board or sail with an integer-cent daily price, then
+call `quote` or `book` with an equipment ID and UTC ISO-8601 timestamps.
+
+A rental period is `[start, end)`: both timestamps must be midnight UTC, and
+`end` is the start of the day after the final rental day. A booking is rejected
+when it overlaps another booking for the same item; periods that only touch at
+their boundary are permitted. Booking IDs are assigned in creation order.
+
+The service has no cancellation operation yet. When it is added, the school
+policy is a full refund at least 24 hours before the booking start and no refund
+after that point.
